				{
					"id": 760240803,
					"content": "你也想要加入吗？那就去找尤尔瓦哥哥吧，他在「斯佩兰扎」。唔，如果要投票的话，赫卡不在呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760240804
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奥妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 760240804,
					"content": "不过没关系，尤尔瓦哥哥肯定有别的办法。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "奥妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 760240805,
					"content": "关于嗅嗅鼹鼠…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760240806
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760240806,
					"content": "我猜是因为它们一直和人生活在一起，所以有些行为也像人一样了。盗宝鼬也是这样，听说纳塔的龙也是这样。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760240807
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奥妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 760240807,
					"content": "不过，这到底是好事还是坏事呢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "奥妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 760240808,
					"content": "再见。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760240809
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760240809,
					"content": "路上要小心哦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "奥妮"
				}
			]
